{"title":"Boar","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 6 Boar that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 6 times (1.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boar\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=0\">Lv 0 <span>466</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=3\">Lv 3 <span>78</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=4\">Lv 4 <span>264</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=5\">Lv 5 <span>243</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=6\">Lv 6 <span>529</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/boar\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>0</b></td><td>12</td><td>1.5</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 2.1 · 150</td><td>466</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Smoldering%20Den\">Smoldering Den</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=3\" title=\"Pick level 3\"><td><b>3</b></td><td>16</td><td>3.1</td><td>150</td><td class=\"muted\">48 · 4.3 · 450</td><td>78</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binx%20Crypt\">Binx Crypt</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=4\" title=\"Pick level 4\"><td><b>4</b></td><td>18</td><td>4</td><td>200</td><td class=\"muted\">54 · 5.6 · 600</td><td>264</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=5\" title=\"Pick level 5\"><td><b>5</b></td><td>20</td><td>5.1</td><td>250</td><td class=\"muted\">60 · 7.1 · 750</td><td>243</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=6\" title=\"Pick level 6\"><td><b>6</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>22</td><td>6.2</td><td>300</td><td class=\"muted\">66 · 8.7 · 900</td><td>529</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"boar\" data-map-level=\"0\">Show level 0 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 30 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 52 recorded drops, 280 total, 1–26 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1–26</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"boar-meat\" title=\"Boar Meat - in 22 of 30 looted corpses, 22 recorded drops, 41 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6878b1d140c68660cf33.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Boar Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bodkin-arrow\" title=\"Bodkin Arr